{"id":"bitter-end","name":"Bitter End","type":"Machine Gun","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7676ddf1e3306b5f61b7d58eadcef875.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/954563454.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Battery","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accelerated Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a51d91da9fb0a4c8f45b2ffa89e51ad7.png","desc":"Slightly reduces damage in exchange for improved cooling."},{"name":"Overclocked Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/01e813d983526b009b4e1c700a1d0081.png","desc":"Slightly increases damage in exchange for reduced cooling."},{"name":"Enhanced Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0ee59b61e99c52c85c2ea18ab705f700.png","desc":"Strong battery life. Reduces heat generation."},{"name":"Ionized Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a278b79aba1d341d2a070c0e48d9129a.png","desc":"A large, heavy battery. Increases the time it takes to vent, in exchange for greatly reduced heat generation."},{"name":"Particle Repeater","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a273117023794757631a34803314351.png","desc":"Improves stability. \n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Projection Fuse","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa6fcec699a88e768782068d5e509e1.png","desc":"Distance optimizations.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Light Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/006ff9fe30b0ef0309b499f364803b6b.png","desc":"Lightweight, agile battery. Increases handling and vent speed."},{"name":"Tactical Heatsink","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ae0d075c978d54c9fcda3cad72e58f62.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple small improvements. Slightly improves stability, vent speed, and range."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Cooling Baubles","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/295dc04060640b2da62789daa321d113.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup, collecting an Orb of Power, or destroying a Tangle reduces heat.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Eddy Current","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e0f3c00a8b2cbccb8f1f1b318026aeee.png","desc":"Temporarily increases reload speed and handling after sprinting or while amplified. This effect is improved when you are amplified."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Trickle Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/17b696e766f345273ddfdda22c8a06f6.png","desc":"Receiving or discharging Bolt Charge partially loads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{"name":"Delicate Tuning","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2f13fda9c012f281539af9efd42ee3f4.png","desc":"While at low heat, this weapon has improved range, handling, and accuracy."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Rolling Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/086174f30d9fbf5e68f473dac9eda710.png","desc":"Final blows grant Bolt Charge.\nWhile amplified, final blows grant additional Bolt Charge."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Offhand Strike","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/599d73ea677633784655fc4161327c14.png","desc":"Final blows grant additional weapon range, stability, and accuracy when firing from the hip for a short duration."},{"name":"Killing Tally","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a64f5d3e972ea35b1789f62999235083.png","desc":"Kills increase this weapon's damage until it is stowed or reloaded."},{"name":"Thermal Atomization","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/38c52b8d37f9c7eb6927cfd20a3995d2.png","desc":"While at high heat, this weapon deals increased damage and causes targets to explode when defeated."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Imperial Allegiance","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c0b62717cdf4e9d6268106164cb878cd.png","desc":"Being near allies grants increased cooling or charge rate, and increased damage while at high heat or low guard energy."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,13,19,26],[0,13,19,31],[0,13,23,26],[0,13,23,31],[0,14,19,26],[0,14,19,31],[0,14,23,26],[0,14,23,31],[0,17,19,26],[0,17,19,31],[0,17,23,26],[0,17,23,31],[2,13,19,26],[2,13,19,31],[2,13,23,26],[2,13,23,31],[2,14,19,26],[2,14,19,31],[2,14,23,26],[2,14,23,31],[2,17,19,26],[2,17,19,31],[2,17,23,26],[2,17,23,31],[4,13,19,26],[4,13,19,31],[4,13,23,26],[4,13,23,31],[4,14,19,26],[4,14,19,31],[4,14,23,31],[4,17,19,26],[4,17,19,31],[4,17,23,26],[4,17,23,31],[0,11,19,26],[0,11,19,27],[0,11,19,28],[0,11,19,31],[0,11,23,26],[0,11,23,27],[0,11,23,28],[0,11,23,31],[0,13,19,27],[0,13,19,28],[0,13,23,27],[0,13,23,28],[0,14,19,27],[0,14,19,2